{"id":61003,"ord":121,"n_segments":146,"prev":61002,"next":61004,"doc":{"id":"70980","title":"70980_Quinn Wilson oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Quinn Wilson","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/70980/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=70980"},"chapter":"Influences, later bands and reflections","title":"Bowing solos with Lefty Bates","category":"music_technique_style","summary":"Arco solos like Slam Stewart.","period":"1950s","year_from":1950,"year_to":1959,"words":82,"start":[176,12],"end":[177,7],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=70980#s61003","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Lefty Bates' band","focus":1,"leader":"Lefty Bates"}]},"people":[{"name":"Slam Stewart","qid":"Q1370114","n":1}],"story":{"theme":14,"theme_name":"Drummers and drumming: who played what, and how","community":41,"community_name":"Bass players: lineage, tone and technique","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":176,"b":12,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Uh-huh. Did you do much bowing work?"},{"p":176,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah, I did a lot of bowing work with Lefty Bates."},{"p":176,"b":14,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Really? That surprised me a little, because from what you've said earlier, it was sort of like a"},{"p":177,"b":0,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"rhythm and blues entertaining group."},{"p":177,"b":1,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Well, it was, but I had some solos I used to take on string bass, and I'd bow them instead of picking."},{"p":177,"b":2,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Oh, I see. Like Slam Stuart?"},{"p":177,"b":3,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Like Slam, yeah."},{"p":177,"b":4,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Would you sing with it?"},{"p":177,"b":5,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"No."},{"p":177,"b":6,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Just arco"},{"p":177,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Just arco."}]}